OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ADutch watchdog tells people not to buy
OL,4,AAI smart glasses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Dutch privacy watchdog the AP has
OL,7,Ftold people not to buy smart glasses,
OL,8,Fsaying they can get things dangerously
OL,9,Fwrong.
OL,11,FIt said in its tests of six glasses
OL,12,Favailable on the Dutch market, the
OL,13,Fdevices advised a user on how to date a
OL,14,Fchild, misread medicine instructions,
OL,15,Fand claimed to to have called an
OL,16,Fambulance when they had not.
OL,18,FWhile the AP is advising people not to
OL,19,Fbuy the smart glasses, it stopped short
OL,20,Fof calling for them to be banned from
OL,21,Fsale.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
